        "created_at": "2017-11-20T23:08:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"bobbertoriley\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/48/1910_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> bobbertoriley:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah, it's a shame that cartoon got cancelled and turned into a chibi knock-off that does nothing but Schlanderize all of the Freedom Five's character quirks. And somehow that ended up being the only thing shown on that network for years.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>My thread sense is tingling. Time to make a fake fandom thread.&nbsp;</p>",
